New files only. Head1000.Certified is the conjunction of the statements of
Zeros0to1000.located/unique/count (vendored definitions, theorems omitted).
From it: CertifiedTable 649 1000, N(1000) = 649, and the head bound
Σ 1/‖ρ‖ ≤ 2.028658 (kernel-checked list facts in Head1000Data). The b = 23
quartic budget with head 1000 is certified at 0.00020152574343131 < 0.00020171.
The assembly copies the 1975 proof with this head. Standard three axioms.

